  "step_3": "The decision reason is not applicable to this decision problem because no outcome has a probability below 20%, so no probability adjustment occurs. Therefore, the reason cannot be used to guide the decision. Furthermore, the individual's justification does not involve any probability adjustment, nor does it reference weighted sums or any rule-based evaluation of probabilities. Instead, the individual appeals to subjective perceptions of small differences and a personal preference for risk. There is no evidence that the individual applied the specific rule described in the decision reason. Hence, the decision reason was not used.",
